{"projectInfo":{"name":"6to4中继典型配置举例","path":"6to4zhongji","visibility":2,"categoryId":34,"introduction":"Router A为6to4路由器，其IPv6侧的网络使用6to4地址。Router B作为6to4中继路由器，它和IPv6网络（2001::/16）相连。要求在Router A和Router B之间配置6to4隧道，使得6to4网络中的主机与IPv6网络中的主机互通。","label":["6to4","中继"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"Host-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Host-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}